     H*****************************************************************
     H* Program Name :  WRDSCHR  ( Type - RPG )
     H* Description  :  To Perform Word Search Using A Subfile With
     H*                 Multiple Arrays
     H* Written      :  N.Shankar.
     H* Dated        :  19 th Jan. 1998.
     H*****************************************************************
     F*
     F* Display File For Word Search
     FWRDSCHD CF  E                    WORKSTN
     F                                        RRN   KSFILE SUBFL
     F*
     E*****************************************************************
     E*
     E* 'Word' Array
     E                    W          11  1
     E*
     E* 'Rows' Array
     E                    R01        11  1
     E                    R02        11  1
     E                    R03        11  1
     E                    R04        11  1
     E                    R05        11  1
     E                    R06        11  1
     E                    R07        11  1
     E                    R08        11  1
     E                    R09        11  1
     E                    R10        11  1
     E                    R11        11  1
     E*
     E* 'Path' Array
     E                    PATH       11  4
     E*
     E* 'Indicator' Array
     E                    HIND       11  1
     E*
     I*****************************************************************
     I*
     I* Program Status Data Structure
     IPGMDS      SDS
     I                                        1  10 PGMNAM
     I                                       37  390#PARMS
     I                                      244 253 WSID
     I                                      254 263 USERID
     I                                      264 2690JOBNO
     I*
     I* Data Structure To Separate Time & Date
     I            DS
     I                                        1  140TIMDAT
     I                                        1   60STIME
     I                                        7  140SDATE
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With The Screen I/O Fields
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 FIELDS
     I                                        1   1 FLD001
     I                                        2   2 FLD002
     I                                        3   3 FLD003
     I                                        4   4 FLD004
     I                                        5   5 FLD005
