     I                                        7   7 FLD007
     I                                        8   8 FLD008
     I                                        9   9 FLD009
     I                                       10  10 FLD010
     I                                       11  11 FLD011
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With The Hidden Indicator Fields
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 HIND
     I                                        1   1 HIND01
     I                                        2   2 HIND02
     I                                        3   3 HIND03
     I                                        4   4 HIND04
     I                                        5   5 HIND05
     I                                        6   6 HIND06
     I                                        7   7 HIND07
     I                                        8   8 HIND08
     I                                        9   9 HIND09
     I                                       10  10 HIND10
     I                                       11  11 HIND11
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With 'R01' Array
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 R01
     I                                        1   1 R01C01
     I                                        2   2 R01C02
     I                                        3   3 R01C03
     I                                        4   4 R01C04
     I                                        5   5 R01C05
     I                                        6   6 R01C06
     I                                        7   7 R01C07
     I                                        8   8 R01C08
     I                                        9   9 R01C09
     I                                       10  10 R01C10
     I                                       11  11 R01C11
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With 'R02' Array
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 R02
     I                                        1   1 R02C01
     I                                        2   2 R02C02
     I                                        3   3 R02C03
     I                                        4   4 R02C04
     I                                        5   5 R02C05
     I                                        6   6 R02C06
     I                                        7   7 R02C07
     I                                        8   8 R02C08
     I                                        9   9 R02C09
     I                                       10  10 R02C10
     I                                       11  11 R02C11
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With 'R03' Array
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 R03
     I                                        1   1 R03C01
     I                                        2   2 R03C02
     I                                        3   3 R03C03
     I                                        4   4 R03C04
     I                                        5   5 R03C05
     I                                        6   6 R03C06
     I                                        7   7 R03C07
     I                                        8   8 R03C08
     I                                        9   9 R03C09
     I                                       10  10 R03C10
     I                                       11  11 R03C11
     I*
     I* Data Structure Mapped With 'R04' Array
     I            DS
     I                                        1  11 R04
     I                                        1   1 R04C01
     I                                        2   2 R04C02
     I                                        3   3 R04C03
     I                                        4   4 R04C04
     I                                        5   5 R04C05
     I                                        6   6 R04C06
     I                                        7   7 R04C07
     I                                        8   8 R04C08
     I                                        9   9 R04C09
     I                                       10  10 R04C10
     I                                       11  11 R04C11
